, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@fifibirdXD/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3980320, "client_id": 227300, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41508d2a0a70cbaeb3d4fddad23b58a2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41508d2a0a70cbaeb3d4fddad23b58a2, https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e883df9044cbb588801addd9f69ccda6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e027d4ac2b7aafb3f0a58c7e5431e0b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d7e8bc85a34583d65e5537a3a85803eb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d7e8bc85a34583d65e5537a3a85803eb, https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ab3507bf15af913268a861dfb0af3297 2x, https://si.imgix.net/75e33e01/uploads/origins/5d77ea42-8c59-46b1-8bab-77f02da447ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a65e2639f0e0420c55082ac354058643 3x"}, "body": "FIFIBIRD，初次见面。我叫Rugetsupepo。\n之前就在X上看到您画的非常棒又可爱的男孩插画，一直想拜托您画一幅。\n如果您有时间的话，请务必帮我画一幅！\n\n我想请您绘制我在兴趣直播中使用的代理角色（颜色酱）。\n这是一个15岁的男孩，身高155～160，长相略带中性气质。\n头发是白色和蓝色的双色，平时看起来有些困倦且恍惚，但该干活的时候很靠谱。\n全身图参考\nhttps://twitter.com/rugetsupepo/status/1690939483074826240\n表情变化参考\nhttps://twitter.com/rugetsupepo/status/1664293689412435968\n新服装\nhttps://x.com/rugetsupepo/status/1906691283889901583\n\n服装和构图等方面请您自由发挥。虽然我上传了角色的服装图，但对于看不见部分的补充等，您可以随心所欲地处理，甚至让角色穿上完全不同的服装也完全没问题。\n如果脸颊和脸部轮廓能画得柔和一些，我会很开心。\n如果能画出帅气与可爱并存的感觉，我会非常高兴。\n希望下巴能画成90度以上的钝角。因为我喜欢那种柔和的感觉……如果觉得很难，或者与您想画的方向不符，不画也没关系。\n\n太极图的配饰也是角色的标志性元素，所以请务必画进去。\n可能会用于社交媒体的头像、封面图以及YouTube等平台。（不会用于营利用途）\n希望角色除底部以外的部分不要被裁切。\n虽然麻烦了，但如果画面中有文字等元素，也希望能提供仅含角色的单独版本。\n文件格式请提供psd或png。\n\n如果因报酬或时间安排等原因无法承接，请直接取消委托。\n如果能接受以上要求，请务必帮忙！！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@fifibirdXD/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3980320, "client_id": 441334, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e40f8f7b/uploads/origins/890c23ad-fa07-4eac-93be-6fe393b6a9a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c735af3c4e4394c86582730969551079", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e40f8f7b/uploads/origins/890c23ad-fa07-4eac-93be-6fe393b6a9a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c735af3c4e4394c86582730969551079, https://si.imgix.net/e40f8f7b/uploads/origins/890c23ad-fa07-4eac-93be-6fe393b6a9a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5a1816e5fb651b7df5668a53d8446ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e40f8f7b/uploads/origins/890c23ad-fa07-4eac-93be-6fe393b6a9a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=071f681b0c8590fb686c4344038f2e3e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e40f8f7b/uploads/origin